 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">AdWhispr</p><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 line-clamp-2 text-sm">Remote MCP server that turns Claude, ChatGPT, or Cursor into a full ad workflow: research any brand&#x27;s live Facebook and TikTok ads, clone the proven winners for your own brand, and launch real campaigns on Google, TikTok</p><div class="text-muted-foreground mt-3 flex items-center gap-4 text-sm"><span class="text-primary inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium transition group-hover:gap-2">Learn more <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></div></div></a><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4"><a href="/servers/instagram-mcp-server-0c7612" class="group border-border bg-card hover:shadow-primary/5 relative flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-md border px-4 pt-4 pb-3 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="border-border/60 bg-secondary/50 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-md border size-12"><img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104488373?v=4" alt="" class="size-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchPriority="auto" width="48" height="48"/></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><h3 class="truncate font-semibold text-[15px]">Instagram MCP Server</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-badge-check text-primary size-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.85 8.62a4 4 0