ugh natural language. An MCP Server that lets any AI agent create and manage complete assessment apps end-to-end.</p><div class="text-muted-foreground mt-auto flex items-center gap-3 pt-1 text-xs"><span class="bg-secondary ml-auto truncate rounded-md px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] tracking-wide uppercase">Other</span></div></a><a href="/clients/poyo-ai-1095ea" class="group border-border bg-card hover:shadow-primary/5 relative flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-md border px-4 pt-4 pb-3 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="border-border/60 bg-secondary/50 size-12 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-md border"><img src="https://cdn.mcp.so/uploads/732581d3c1b54526ef807d71e79d47e1.webp" alt="" class="size-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchPriority="auto" width="48" height="48"/></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><h3 class="truncate text-[15px] leading-tight font-semibold">PoYo.ai</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-badge-check text-primary size-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles size-3.5 shrink-0 text-amber-500" aria-label="Featured"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg></div><p class="text-muted-foreground truncate text-xs">poyo.ai</p></div></div><p class="text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2 min-h-10 text-sm">PoYo.ai gives developers one API key for 500+ AI models, including GPT Image 2, Seedance 2, Sora 2, Gemini 3, and Claude. Credit pricing, polling/webhook workflow, failed tasks not charged.</p><div class="text-muted-foreground mt-auto flex items-center gap-3 pt-1 text-xs"><span class="bg-secondary ml-auto truncate rounded-md px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] tracking-wide uppercase">Web Chat &amp; UIs</span></div></a><a href="/clients/prism" class="group border-border bg-card hover:shadow-primary/5 relative flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-md border px-4 pt-4 pb-3 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="border-border/60 bg-secondary/50 size-12 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-md border"><img src="https://cdn.mcp.so/uploads/1ffca4d2fe48c6de3dc796ba9950f29b.png" alt="" class="size-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchPriority="auto" width="48" height="48"/></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><h3 class="truncate text-[15px] leading-tight font-semibold">Prism – Contract Deadline Reader</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-badge-check text-primary size-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles size-3.5 shrink-0 text-amber-500" aria-label="Featured"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg></div><p class="text-muted-foreground truncate text-xs">Built AI, Inc.</p></div></div><p class="text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2 min-h-10 text-sm">Give your AI agent a contract reader. Prism reads leases, mortgages, insurance policies and HOA documents and returns every deadline with its exact date, what happens if it is missed, and the sentence it came from. Remot</p><div class="text-muted-foreground mt-auto flex items-center gap-3 pt-1 text-xs"><span class="bg-secondary ml-auto truncate rounded-md px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] tracking-wide uppercase">Other</span></div></a></div></div></section><section class="py-8 sm:py-10"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4 pb-4"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl">Featured CLI tools</h2><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm">Official and agent-ready command-line tools for everyday workflows</p></div><a href="/cli" class="text-primary inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium hover:underline">View all<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><a href="/cli/bun" class="group border-border bg-card hover:border-prim