ine-clamp-2 min-h-10 text-sm">Gives AI agents public URLs (tunnels) for localhost, live HTTP traffic inspection, snapshot publishing, and access control. Part of LocalCan, the ngrok alternative for Mac, Windows and Linux. Free plan.</p><div class="text-muted-foreground flex items-center gap-2 text-xs"><span class="ml-auto shrink-0" title="08/08/2026, 07:18 PM">Added 2 months ago</span></div><div class="text-muted-foreground mt-auto flex items-center gap-3 pt-1 text-xs"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star size-3.5 fill-amber-400 text-amber-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path></svg>82</span></div></a><a href="/servers/openlore" class="group border-border bg-card hover:shadow-primary/5 relative flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-md border px-4 pt-4 pb-3 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="border-border/60 bg-secondary/50 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-md border size-12"><img src="https://cdn.mcp.so/uploads/ee34391f9694b2c5d9019f3cb121691b.png" alt="" class="size-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchPriority="auto" width="48" height="48"/></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><h3 class="truncate font-semibold text-[15px]">OpenLore</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-badge-check text-primary size-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles size-3.5 shrink-0 text-amber-500" aria-label="Featured"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg></div><p class="text-muted-foreground truncate text-xs">aakarim</p></div></div><p class="text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2 min-h-10 text-sm">Serve your docs to AI agents over SSH and MCP. Agents use ls, cat, grep, find, and pipes against a virtual filesystem backed by your documentation. Identity-scoped access, governed writing with human approval, and portab</p><div class="text-muted-foreground flex items-center gap-2 text-xs"><span class="ml-auto shrink-0" title="08/26/2026, 05:09 PM">Added last month</span></div><div class="text-muted-foreground mt-auto flex items-center gap-3 pt-1 text-xs"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star size-3.5 fill-amber-400 text-amber-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.7