arch and traditional search, then hands your agent the next growth move, already drafted.",iconUrl:"https://cdn.mcp.so/uploads/fe8aa8299612d8cf0918990f5ee4cc89.png",authorName:"Team AfterLaunch",rating:void 0,ratingCount:void 0,installCount:void 0,stars:void 0,verified:!0,featured:!0,editorPick:!1,categoryName:"Data & Analytics",categorySlug:void 0,status:"published",isRemote:!0,createdAt:"2026-09-13T17:38:20.763Z"},$R[71]={id:"cce921bb-27cd-4d01-8fcb-fe43116b11a1",slug:"termany",name:"Termany",tagline:"Agent-Native Terminal",iconUrl:"https://cdn.mcp.so/uploads/c9c490b994c82c8c4fe1b1e3efc24dd0.png",authorName:"thinkany-ai",rating:void 0,ratingCount:void 0,installCount:void 0,stars:174,verified:!0,featured:!0,editorPick:!1,categoryName:"Developer Tools",categorySlug:void 0,status:"published",isRemote:!1,createdAt:"2026-07-28T11:29:17.645Z"},$R[72]={id:"ca405dff-c07c-4093-9f0e-2e191fd22760",slug:"aevia-lca-modeler",name:"Aevia LCA Modeler",tagline:"Aevia LCA Modeler is a remote MCP server available at https://app.aeviamodeler.ai.",iconUrl:void 0,authorName:void 0,rating:void 0,ratingCount:void 0,installCount:void 0,stars:void 0,verified:!0,featured:!0,editorPick:!1,categoryName:void 0,categorySlug:void 0,status:"published",isRemote:!0,createdAt:"2026-09-24T06:28:22.484Z"},$R[73]={id:"d51a995b-5d05-4910-82ca-088f0c7e8b7a",slug:"medplum",name:"Medplum",tagline:"Medplum is a healthcare platform that helps you quickly develop high-quality compliant applications.",iconUrl:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75462971?v=4",authorName:"medplum",rating:void 0,ratingCount:void 0,installCount:void 0,stars:2545,verified:!0,featured:!0,editorPick:!1,categoryName:void 0,categorySlug:void 0,status:"published",isRemote:!1,createdAt:"2026-07-26T00:21:23.061Z"},$R[74]={id:"8f6ca48d-708e-42c0-adf4-566c9e32f43e",slug:"aisa",name:"AIsa",tagline:"AIsa is one key for 950+ data APIs across SEO and AI visibility, finance, social, web search, sales and agent mail — the go-to-market data stack behind prospecting, competitor research and brand monitoring. Five tools ra",iconUrl:"https://cdn.mcp.so/uploads/dd6ff40fe81860e9ea67ce81d3418bff.svg",authorName:"AIsa",rating:void 0,ratingCount:void 0,installCount:void 0,stars:void 0,verified:!0,featured:!0,editorPick:!1,categoryName:"Data & Analytics",categorySlug:void 0,status:"published",isRemote:!0,createdAt:"2026-09-15T14:47:50.619Z"},$R[75]={id:"ebf52616-7b3a-422d-8ad0-bc29bdc90ebe",slug:"plur",name:"PLUR",tagline:"AI agents start every session with amnesia — you re-explain the project, repeat your preferences, and correct the same mistakes over and over. PLUR gives them a memory that persists.\n\nYour agent's corrections, preference",iconUrl:"https://cdn.mcp.so/uploads/9e58505c6cb490cc371926850626936c.png",authorName:"plur-ai",rating:void 0,ratingCount:void 0,installCount:void 0,stars:226,verified:!0,featured:!0,editorPick:!1,categoryName:"Memory & Knowledge",categorySlug:void 0,status:"published",isRemote:!1,createdAt:"2026-07-24T22:20:54.394Z"},$R[76]={id:"1403996f-9d34-489c-9ac2-762d35c8b56d",slug:"afterlaunch-e7345c",name:"AfterLaunch",tagline:"AfterLaunch is a remote MCP server available at https://afterlaunch.io.",iconUrl:void 0,authorName:void 0,rating:void 0,ratingCount:void 0,installCount:void 0,stars:void 0,verified:!0,featured:!0,editorPick:!1,categoryName:void 0,categorySlug:void 0,status:"published",isRemote:!0,createdAt:"2026-09-17T17:04:46.964Z"},$R[77]={id:"6b22c85b-2d07-4564-bdeb-2968e334d6dd",slug:"api-direct",name:"API Direct",tagline:"Search public social, news and local-business data across 13 platforms through one MCP server — LinkedIn, X/Twitter, Facebook, Reddit, YouTube, Instagram, Threads, TikTok, Truth Social, forums, news, web search and Googl",iconUrl:"https://cdn.mcp.so/uploads/b7fe52247ecc98a008228afc5765f966.png",authorName:"API Direct",rating:void 0,ratingCount:void 0,installCount:void 0,stars:void 0,verified:!0,featured:!0,editorPick:!1,categoryName:"Data & Analytics",c