conomic and other official data from 170+ publishers including World Bank, IMF, BIS, ECB, Eurostat, and National Statistical Offices.  Aard is powered by a large graph of the metadata universe and an ",iconUrl:"https://cdn.mcp.so/uploads/83b70fab3dedfccbbdfe1ac385bf7974.png",authorName:"Braddon Lance",rating:void 0,ratingCount:void 0,installCount:void 0,stars:void 0,verified:!0,featured:!0,editorPick:!1,categoryName:"Data & Analytics",categorySlug:void 0,status:"published",isRemote:!0,createdAt:"2026-09-15T13:22:00.734Z"},$R[82]={id:"f23e2ba7-b7a4-4ae1-a97b-18780bc49be6",slug:"ai-video-mcp-by-aituber",name:"AI Video MCP by AITuber",tagline:"AI Video MCP by AITuber is a hosted MCP server that lets AI agents create and publish video. You connect it once, then ask your agent for a video in plain language. It writes the script, picks a voice, generates the visu",iconUrl:"https://cdn.mcp.so/uploads/f3253aba3197a0e9dc4cf6af6a647ccb.png",authorName:"aituberapp",rating:void 0,ratingCount:void 0,installCount:void 0,stars:void 0,verified:!0,featured:!0,editorPick:!1,categoryName:void 0,categorySlug:void 0,status:"published",isRemote:!0,createdAt:"2026-08-04T20:35:07.151Z"},$R[83]={id:"9cff8736-5a59-4967-8461-0ab2a856ec30",slug:"aoi-environmental-intelligence",name:"AOI — Environmental Intelligence",tagline:"AOI is a commercial environmental-intelligence gateway that gives AI agents programmatic access to 38 real-world intelligence capabilities — climate risk, satellite monitoring, methane detection, water & soil, vegetation",iconUrl:"https://cdn.mcp.so/uploads/c5af895529a9cc434712975fcaabaad0.jpg",authorName:"amin shojaei",rating:void 0,ratingCount:void 0,installCount:void 0,stars:void 0,verified:!0,featured:!0,editorPick:!1,categoryName:"Data & Analytics",categorySlug:void 0,status:"published",isRemote:!0,createdAt:"2026-09-20T17:22:50.342Z"},$R[84]={id:"9f3f8936-e434-42a5-9cca-19d99a4b3e29",slug:"openziti-mcp-gateway",name:"OpenZiti MCP Gateway",tagline:"NetFoundry MCP Gateway enables secure, isolated access to Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools across distributed systems without exposing public endpoints. Zero trust gateway for MCP servers. Aggregate, filter, and secure",iconUrl:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65675559?v=4",authorName:"openziti",rating:void 0,ratingCount:void 0,installCount:void 0,stars:48,verified:!0,featured:!0,editorPick:!1,categoryName:"AI & Agents",categorySlug:void 0,status:"published",isRemote:!1,createdAt:"2026-09-10T22:43:54.546Z"},$R[85]={id:"c1ba0514-53b6-43c8-81f6-c499b94262e6",slug:"affiliatespy",name:"AffiliateSpy",tagline:"Find the TikTok, YouTube and Instagram creators and the blogs, review sites and roundups already promoting your competitors, with the proof, then recruit them. 32 tools: competitor rosters, graded creators, roundup place",iconUrl:void 0,authorName:"Savassi Limited",rating:void 0,ratingCount:void 0,installCount:void 0,stars:void 0,verified:!0,featured:!0,editorPick:!1,categoryName:"Data & Analytics",categorySlug:void 0,status:"published",isRemote:!0,createdAt:"2026-09-17T07:35:46.245Z"},$R[86]={id:"71ab21ee-5555-4c0d-a295-c6e7650d027b",slug:"google-search-mcp-server-dbfaf4",name:"Google Search MCP Server",tagline:"Hosted Google Search / SERP MCP server from HasData, no Google Cloud project. Organic results, AI Overview, People Also Ask, AI Mode, news and shopping for Claude, Cursor and any MCP client.",iconUrl:"https://cdn.mcp.so/uploads/d6cd60d7c4414aa2020099a7ab1b79f2.png",authorName:"HasData",rating:void 0,ratingCount:void 0,installCount:void 0,stars:23,verified:!0,featured:!0,editorPick:!1,categoryName:"Search",categorySlug:void 0,status:"published",isRemote:!1,createdAt:"2026-09-10T18:25:28.156Z"},$R[87]={id:"e67cf15b-89d0-46ef-8267-f2f9ea8785dc",slug:"adaptlypost",name:"AdaptlyPost",tagline:"AdaptlyPost: Schedule and publish social posts to Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, X, Facebook, LinkedIn, Pinterest, Threads, and Bluesky from any MCP client.",iconUrl:"https://cdn.mcp.s